From: havok2-htwo <havok2-htwo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:24:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] serve: a request waiting for a slot keeps its estimate
 and arrival, admission noted at the first read, nan wait as before (opt-in
 STRATA_ADMIT_BY_NEW=1)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 serve/server.py         | 45 ++++++++++++++++++---------
 serve/test_admit_est.py | 68 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 98 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/serve/server.py b/serve/server.py
